    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks! I don't know why I didn't think about this in the first place, because custom directives in 'nvim-treesitter' are quite common. Probably because of small performance penalty and handling of dependency.\r\n\r\nIt needs some further non-trivial updates (a little bit of refactor and tricky tests), so I'll take it from here.",
